  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b000001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "start_line": 1,
      "end_line": 1,
      "raw": "# Native Text Document Gallery\n",
      "level": 1,
      "title": "Native Text Document Gallery"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000002",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 2,
      "end_line": 2,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 3,
      "end_line": 5,
      "raw": "A Qt-free C++23 document-model explorer compiled from LVUI and painted by iiGUI.\niiSDKCore owns the application entry, event loop, workers, frames and view lifetime.\nThe model loads file-backed lines, edits one range and publishes through iiFileProvider Native.\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000004",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 6,
      "end_line": 6,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 7,
      "end_line": 8,
      "raw": "This example demonstrates the nonvisual foundation. The separate native CodeEditor\ngallery provides a PlainText viewport; RichText TextEditor and full IME/source parity remain pending.\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000006",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 9,
      "end_line": 9,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 10,
      "end_line": 13,
      "raw": "Configure against installed Core, LVUI, iiGUI, LVRS and iiFileProvider Native packages.\n`install.sh` builds and installs into its first argument (default `build/install`) without\nlaunching the app or tests. With no arguments the app keeps an in-memory sample.\n`--document PATH` opens or attaches a destination; Save publishes only on request.\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000008",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 14,
      "end_line": 14,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 15,
      "end_line": 17,
      "raw": "All test and app execution is deferred to the final whole-goal batch. The registered\nself-test creates its fixture through iiFileProvider inside the supplied build directory.\nSee [usage](docs/Usage.md) and the [SDK document contract](../../docs/native/TextDocuments.md).\n"
    }
  ],
